( https://albiononline.com/news/lands-awakened-live )

Adventurer,

The new *Druid Vanity Bundle* is here! This premiere bundle is available in=
 the in-game store, and includes a full *costume set* plus a matching *Stag=
 mount skin*.

The bundle transforms your character into a powerful, learned figure in tou=
ch with the mysteries of Albion=E2=80=99s natural world. The bundle works f=
or male and female characters alike, and with a *thick, forest-green cape* =
and a *crown of antlers* you will be ready to unleash Albion=E2=80=99s natu=
ral forces upon your enemies. In addition, your Stag will become a noble, m=
agical creature, which along with your character will shine through the nig=
ht with the mystical glow of fireflies.

As with past bundles, you can use all costume and mount skins with *all cha=
racters on your account* , and they are never lost or destroyed. Get this p=
remiere bundle today and harness the powers of nature!

( https://albiononline.com/news/lands-awakened-soundtrack )

Lands Awakened Soundtrack Released
----------------------------------

One of the major changes that came to the world of Albion with the recent *=
Lands Awakened* update was a revamped and expanded orchestral score, and th=
is stunning soundtrack is available now!

With *seventeen brand new tracks* , this promises to really enrich the expe=
rience of forging your path through the world of Albion. The soundtrack inc=
ludes:

* Themes for each of *Albion=E2=80=99s cities* which beautifully capture th=
e characteristics of their inhabitants
* Tense, invigorating *combat and boss music*
* A mystical, evocative soundtrack to the *Destiny Board*
* New *Hideout* music for the their different stages of development
* A dedicated soundtrack for the *Tutorial and Starter Towns*
* The previously unreleased *Hellgate* music

Listen to the soundtrack now on *YouTube ( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=
=3D0hDqfF-xm4w&list=3DPLvJxnupyVHJgq-L3lXhQcYtstFk7xzeDl&index=3D1 )* and *=
all major streaming platforms ( https://distrokid.com/hyperfollow/sandboxin=
teractiveandjonnevaltonenandmariehavemann/albion-online-lands-awakened-orig=
inal-game-soundtrack )* !

( https://albiononline.com/news/season-14-kickoff )

Season 14 Underway
------------------

Albion=E2=80=99s fourteenth Guild Season has begun, with sweeping changes t=
o make guild warfare more competitive and exciting than ever before. Most n=
otably, this season sees the beginning of the *Conqueror=E2=80=99s Challeng=
e* , which replaces the previous Guild Season reward system. Alongside this=
 comes the introduction of *Might, Favor, Guild Might Levels, Energy Crysta=
ls, Power Cores* , and *Headquarters Hideouts.*

For a rundown of the new features and the Season Rewards on offer, check ou=
t this *news article* ( https://albiononline.com/news/season-14-kickoff ).

Alongside these season changes, the Lands Awakened update brings massive im=
provements to Albion=E2=80=99s open world, a new weapon line, the Druid Van=
ity Set, and more. Click here for details:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/lands-awakened-live )

